# MANIFEST — the allowlist of record.
#
# Every file riprap installs into a project is named here. Nothing is copied
# because it happens to sit in template/; install reads THIS file and refuses
# anything not listed.
#
# That is deliberate. A recursive copy will happily carry a .pyc, a .DS_Store, or
# an editor backup into someone else's public repo — and a compiled artifact
# embeds absolute source paths and identifiers that no text scrubber can see
# inside.
#
# Two tiers:
#   template  upstream keeps it current; `riprap update` refreshes it unless the
#             project edited it, in which case the conflict is reported.
#   seed      the project's own from the moment it lands; never overwritten.
#
# Generated by bin/build-manifest. Do not hand-edit — CI checks it matches the
# tree, and a hand-edit that drifts fails in whichever direction you did not test.
#
# Format: tier<TAB>path

